/P 11689 0 R
/E (The Government must always enjoy majority support in the popular   House to remain in power. If need be, it has to demonstrate its strength on the floor   of the House either by moving a Motion of Confidence and winning the confidence of   the House or by defeating a No-confidence Motion brought against it by the parties in Opposition)
/Pg 63 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
