/E (The Committees of Public Accounts and Public Undertakings are not Joint  Committees. They are primarily Committees of the Lok Sabha. The Committees are   formed on a motion adopted by the Lok Sabha and members of the Rajya Sabha are   nominated to these Committees in response to an independent motion requesting for   the association of the members of the Rajya Sabha with the Committees, adopted   by the Lok Sabha and concurred in by the Rajya Sabha. Even if the Rajya Sabha does   not concur with the motion or the members of the Rajya Sabha do not associate   with Committees, the Committees continue to function. )
